    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\U0001F539 1. Interactive Learning Modules\L Learn wireless optical communication
    concepts through immersive, scenario-based tutorials enhanced with animations,
    3D visualizations, and real-time guidance.\n\U0001F539 2. Virtual Lab (V-Lab)\L
    Practice measuring signal loss, adjusting components, and simulating optical
    setups in a safe, hands-on virtual environment\u2014no physical tools required.\n\U0001F539
    3. Smart AI Assistance\L I\u2019ll monitor your learning progress and offer real-time
    explanations, hints, or corrections tailored to your actions.\n\U0001F539 4.
    Progress Tracking & Missions\L Track your journey with personalized dashboards,
    complete missions, and unlock achievements as you master each topic.\n\u2728
    To get started, just tap any module on the home screen or say \"Hey Ovira, help
    me begin.\" I\u2019ll take it from there!"
