          3D visualizations, and real-time guidance. \U0001F539 2. Virtual Lab (V-Lab)\L
          Practice measuring signal loss, adjusting components, and simulating optical
          setups in a safe, hands-on virtual environment\u2014no physical tools required.
          \U0001F539 3. Smart AI Assistance\L I\u2019ll monitor your learning progress
          and offer real-time explanations, hints, or corrections tailored to your
          actions. \U0001F539 4. Progress Tracking & Missions\L Track your journey
          with personalized dashboards, complete missions, and unlock achievements
          as you master each topic. \u2728 To get started, just tap any module on
          the home screen or say \"Hey Ovira, help me begin.\" I\u2019ll take it
          from there!"
        - Interactive Lear
